-- נספחים ב'1 ו־ג'1 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101): the Ofek 2022 supplement of a first-degree (BA)
-- teacher, by grade — from 1.9.2022 (annex ב'1) and, twice as much, from
-- 1.9.2023 (annex ג'1) — as the corpus publishes them among the tables. They
-- are annexes ב1 and ג1 of the wage agreement of 19.10.2022, whose §5
-- pays the supplement by them, and which the agreement's signed copy prints
-- after its signatures (encoded, imported).
--
-- Checked here: each is the signed copy's annex grade for grade and prints
-- the day §5 applies it from. Like those annexes they are printed to the
-- shekel; the follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025 (§3, imported)
-- replaced them by annexes printed to the agora, and every amount here is
-- the decision's to the nearest shekel.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספחים ב'1 ו־ג'1 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח ב'1"; the table below is that annex.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 The page number written in by hand (2); no rule.

-- Annex ב'1: from 1.9.2022, as it prints under it.
@ref akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/t1 akn:hc_1/p4
`annex ב'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)" (JUST 101) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
        (LIST `cell` 1 793, `cell` 2 668, `cell` 3 543, `cell` 4 418, `cell` 5 293, `cell` 6 168, `cell` 7 93, `cell` 8 18, `cell` 9 0)

-- akn:hc_1/p5 The next annex's label, "נספח ג'1"; the table below is that annex.

-- Annex ג'1: from 1.9.2023, as it prints under it.
@ref akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/t2 akn:hc_1/p7
`annex ג'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)" (JUST 101) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023)
        (LIST `cell` 1 1586, `cell` 2 1336, `cell` 3 1086, `cell` 4 836, `cell` 5 586, `cell` 6 336, `cell` 7 186, `cell` 8 36, `cell` 9 0)

§§ `בדיקת הטבלאות`

-- (1) The days: §5.1's 1.9.2022 and §5.2's 1.9.2023, as the signed copy's
-- annexes print them.
#ASSERT `annex ב'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex ב1 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex ג'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex ג1 of the signed copy`

-- (2) The signed copy's annexes ב1 and ג1, grade for grade, nine grades each.
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's supplement for BA in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for BA in` `annex ב1 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for BA in` `annex ג1 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for BA in` `annex ב1 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 9
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for BA in` `annex ג1 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 9

-- (3) The decision of 14.1.2025: its annexes ב1 and ג1, printed to the agora,
-- govern in these annexes' place; every amount here is theirs to the
-- nearest shekel (convention rounding.half).
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the decision's supplement for BA to the shekel in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD
        CONSIDER `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g
        WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (`to the nearest whole` x)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the decision's supplement for BA to the shekel in` `annex ב1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ב'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the decision's supplement for BA to the shekel in` `annex ג1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ג'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))

-- The supplements at work: §5's supplement for a half position at grade
-- 1 on 1.9.2022, as the signed copy pays it, beside annex ב'1.
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex ב'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1 EQUALS JUST (396.5 TIMES 2)
#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1 0.5 EQUALS JUST 396.5
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2023) `annex ג'1 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1 EQUALS NOTHING
